**Heading
nonlinear buckling analysis, skirt without openings and holes under load, shell mesh

*INCLUDE, INPUT=noholes_S8R_256.inp
**INCLUDE, INPUT=base_plate_center_YFIX.nam
**INCLUDE, INPUT=skir_sless_top_LOAD.nam
*BOUNDARY
base_plate_center_YFIX,1,1
base_plate_center_YFIX,3,3
skir_sless_top_LOAD,1,1

*MATERIAL,NAME=STEEL
*ELASTIC
2.09000000e+05, 2.80000000e-01
*DENSITY
7.8E-9

*SHELL SECTION, ELSET=skir_carbo_und, MATERIAL=STEEL
25
*SHELL SECTION, ELSET=skir_carbo_mid, MATERIAL=STEEL
25
*SHELL SECTION, ELSET=skir_sless, MATERIAL=STEEL
25

** step 1, nonlinear displacement control buckling analysis 
*STEP,NLGEOM,INC=10000
*STATIC
0.02,1,1e-5,0.1 
*BOUNDARY
skir_sless_top_LOAD,3,3,100
*NODE FILE, OUTPUT=2D
U
*EL FILE
S, PEEQ  
*NODE PRINT, NSET=base_plate_center_YFIX, TOTALS=ONLY
RF

*END STEP